WEBVTT

00:15.000 --> 00:16.400
Drink the medicine

00:16.600 --> 00:18.933
The military doctor prescribed it for pain

00:22.600 --> 00:24.000
One more sip

00:24.240 --> 00:25.640
I don't want it

00:28.080 --> 00:31.080
How did it come to be you lying here?

00:32.520 --> 00:33.920
I heard

00:34.400 --> 00:37.040
You grabbed a horse in the palace and rushed out

00:37.120 --> 00:38.240
The people below

00:38.320 --> 00:39.720
Couldn't stop you

00:39.800 --> 00:41.280
It's only been a few days

00:41.360 --> 00:44.027
And you rushed here in such a hurry

00:44.400 --> 00:45.800
So worried about me

00:46.720 --> 00:49.680
Your servant heard Your Majesty was hit by an arrow

00:49.760 --> 00:51.760
That's why I was so anxious

00:53.880 --> 00:55.280
When Your Majesty is safe

00:55.360 --> 00:57.027
The state will be safe

